      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Malin%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Malin is famous for the horseradish plant, which was discovered by the town's original settlers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Malin%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Many descendants of the original Czech families still call Malin home and maintain their family farms.",
